39:14.500 --> 39:16.770
♫ Berdiam ♫

39:16.770 --> 39:19.250
♫ Masa mengeluh tanpa bunyi ♫

39:17.140 --> 39:18.100
dan...

39:19.250 --> 39:24.120
♫ Masa siapa ♫

39:20.300 --> 39:20.980
Luo Ning.

39:20.980 --> 39:22.340
Ah Fu yang

39:25.500 --> 39:26.760
