39:27.740 --> 39:28.580
Luo Ning.

39:31.420 --> 39:32.370
Abang.

39:36.860 --> 39:38.940
Lepaskan dia.

39:40.460 --> 39:41.140
Abang.

39:46.300 --> 39:48.340
