39:54.910 --> 40:00.070
♫ Aku berharap rindu seperti awan putih di luar halaman ♫

39:56.130 --> 39:57.220
Luo Ning.

39:58.700 --> 39:59.780
Luo Ning!

39:59.780 --> 40:00.460
Luo Ning!

